Okuphumayo bhala: ['Test object'], umugqa-omusha.
>> a := Into okusha. 

a uma-kufika: ['item:'] yenza: { :moment
	okwakho moment := moment. 
}.

a uma-kufika: ['item'] yenza: { <- okwakho moment.
}.

>> today := Isikhathi okusha indawo-yesikhathi: ['CEST'], unyaka: 2026, inyanga: 7.
a item: today.
Okuphumayo bhala: a item, umugqa-omusha.
a save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].

